# DDScope — Architecture ToBe

## Quick Start
Central architecture reference for the ToBe modular design of DDScope.
Describes the three concerns (Core, Framework, Service), the Core module inventory, and the abstract interfaces.
Load when reasoning about module boundaries, defining a new interface, or planning the migration.
Does not list frameworks or service implementations — see DDScope_Assemblies.md.
Does not specify interface APIs — see the dedicated doc for each interface.

